# The Beast of Bastore (abyssea 172) at the Jugner Forest zone-in beside Face of the Future (crystalWar 61) at Prog 0
# from Batallia Downs: a level 99 Warrior in Batallia Downs with The Beast of Bastore accepted, the Sedna Tuskbreaker
# title (a GM, after the login), Chasing Shadows completed and Face of the Future accepted (GMs; the missions as its
# flows have them). Jugner Forest from Batallia Downs: both zone-ins answer: the first csid in container order plays:
# The Beast of Bastore's 49 (its container comes before Face of the Future's), left open, finished: Lunar Abyssite II,
# completed. Back to Batallia Downs and in again: Face of the Future's 44, left open, finished: its Prog 1.
lists JugnerForest/onZoneIn/1 JugnerForest/onEventUpdate/49 JugnerForest/onEventFinish/49 JugnerForest/onEventFinish/44
char zone=BatalliaDowns pos=-48,0.1,435 job=WAR lvl=99
quest Abyssea.AJourneyBegins completed
quest Abyssea.TheTruthBeckons completed
quest Abyssea.DawnOfDeath accepted
quest Abyssea.TheBeastOfBastore accepted
quest CrystalWar.ChasingShadows completed
quest CrystalWar.FaceOfTheFuture accepted
mission Wotg TheScentOfBattle current
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
login
title SednaTuskbreaker                  # a GM
warp -285.493,-7.819,-163.707 JugnerForest open # both answer: 49 first
finish                                  # Lunar Abyssite II; completed
warp -48,0.1,435 BatalliaDowns          # out
warp -285.493,-7.819,-163.707 JugnerForest open # from Batallia Downs again: 44
finish                                  # Face of the Future: Prog 1
